              Brochure payload figures (such as 1,155 lbs) represent an unoptioned base truck. Factory options (sunroof, skid plates, rock sliders, bed covers) and dealer accessories subtract from payload pound-for-pound. Door-jamb stickers on optioned TRD Off-Road Double Cabs often show certified payloads between 1,000 and 1,120 lbs. Always use the exact number printed on your vehicle's Tire and Loading Information placard.
